(21075: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: parity%2Fgrammars%2Fnative%2Ftsx.lino%20is%20a%20canonical%20native%20Links%20Notation%20grammar%20that%20js%2Fscripts%2Fimport-native-grammars.mjs%20imports%20from%20the%20pinned%20tsx%2Fsrc%2Fgrammar.json%20of%20tree-sitter-typescript%200.23.2%2C%20with%20every%20rule%20renamed%20to%20its%20English%20name%2C%20its%20external%20scanner%20common%2Fscanner.h%20ported%20to%20the%20seven%20native%20scanners%20of%20parity%2Fgrammars%2Fscanners%2Ftypescript.lino%20%28automatic%20semicolons%2C%20template%20characters%2C%20the%20ternary%20question%20mark%2C%20HTML-like%20comments%20and%20JSX%20text%2C%20and%20the%20automatic%20semicolon%20after%20a%20function%20signature%20and%20the%20error%20recovery%20sentinel%2C%20which%20fail%20as%20their%20C%20scanner%20never%20returns%20them%29%2C%20and%20every%20hand%20decision%20recorded%20in%20parity%2Fgrammars%2Fmerge-reports%2Ftsx.json.%20Both%20executors%20build%2C%20for%20every%20source%20of%20the%20upstream%20test%2Fcorpus%20the%20oracle%20accepts%20and%20the%20added%20cases%2C%20exactly%20the%20concrete%20syntax%20tree%20rows%20of%20the%20tree-sitter-typescript%20oracle%20with%20no%20ambiguity%3A%20interfaces%2C%20type%20aliases%2C%20enums%2C%20namespaces%2C%20ambient%20declarations%2C%20generics%2C%20union%2C%20intersection%2C%20conditional%2C%20mapped%20and%20template%20literal%20types%2C%20decorators%2C%20as%2C%20satisfies%20and%20non-null%20expressions%2C%20instantiation%20expressions%20and%20JSX%20elements%20in%20place%20of%20the%20type%20assertion%20included.%20Both%20executors%20reject%20invalid%20input%20the%20oracle%20recovers%20from%2C%20repair%20it%20into%20the%20recorded%20tree%2C%20and%20keep%20every%20source%20byte%2C%20comments%20and%20white%20space%20included%2C%20in%20the%20tree.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
